mutable struct Box over T
    T value
end struct

mutable struct Node over T
    T value
    optional Node of T next
end struct

function same_box over T takes Box of T bx returns Box of T is
    return bx
end function

function some_node takes Node of string n returns optional Node of string is
    return n
end function

constant nb is make Box with value 10
constant nb2 is the result of same_box nb
say nb is nb2
change value of nb2 to 12
say nb
constant boxes is list of nb
say item 1 of boxes
constant a is make Node with value "a", next none
constant b is make Node with value "b", next none
change next of a to b
change next of b to a
say a
change next of b to none
variable cursor is the result of some_node a
repeat while cursor is not none
    say value of cursor
    change cursor to next of cursor
end repeat
